==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|про-|пить}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|пропи́ть}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|пропи́ть|pf|impf=пропива́ть}}

# to [[spend]]/[[squander]] [[on]] [[drink]]
#: {{coi|ru|'''пропи́ть''' [[вещь|ве́щи]]|to sell one's things to get money for drink; swap one's things for drink}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[ruin]] [[through]] [[drinking]]
#: {{coi|ru|'''пропи́ть''' [[го́лос]]|to ruin/lose one's voice through drinking}}
# to [[finish]] a [[course]] of, to [[complete]] a course of, to [[take]] a course of
#: {{coi|ru|'''пропи́ть''' [[курс]] [[лека́рств]]|}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|11b/c(1),c+p|пропи́ть}}

